		Paper: A5
		Margin: 16mm 14mm 18mm 20mm
		Mirror margins: true
	Title: Orchard and Field · Chapter 4 of The Slow Autumn Kitchen
	Subject: Two autumn recipes: roast squash with sage brown butter, and a pear and walnut cake
	Author: Hanna Brookes
	Keywords: cookbook, autumn, squash, pear, walnut
